cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the paper.
title: >-
  Analysis code for "Low-Grade Albuminuria and Mortality Across Blood Pressure
  Levels and Treatment Status in US Adults with Preserved eGFR and Without
  Self-Reported Major Cardiovascular Disease"
abstract: >-
  Survey-weighted Cox analysis of NHANES 1999-2018 linked to the 2019 public-use
  mortality files, examining all-cause mortality across urinary
  albumin-to-creatinine ratio categories within six blood-pressure and
  antihypertensive-treatment states. Includes cohort derivation from the raw
  NHANES files, all statistical tests, and the figure generators.
type: software
